                                "sense_id": "ef21fc08-dbc2-3075-a57f-5122cc7c915f",
                                "text": "Aircoaches are big money-makers for the five or six airlines that use them. They do a near-capacity business on midnight runs for passengers who don't mind the night-flying and who like the lower prices."
                            },
